sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Cust as 👤 Customer
    participant CPortal as Customer Portal<br/>(stapp-portal SWA)
    participant EG as Event Grid<br/>(evgt system topic)
    participant Blob as Blob Storage<br/>(stqqvftbiyd7fmk / ingest)
    participant Func as Function App<br/>(func-qqvftbiyd7fmk-app)
    participant Foundry as AI Foundry<br/>(rgdev-foundry / DeepSeek)
    participant Cosmos as Cosmos DB<br/>(disputes / timeline / evidence)
    participant DF as Durable Functions<br/>(orchestrator)
    actor Analyst as 🧑‍⚖️ Analyst
    participant APortal as Analyst Portal<br/>(stapp SWA)
    participant Fabric as Fabric + Power BI

    Cust->>CPortal: File dispute
    CPortal->>Func: POST /api/disputes (create_dispute)
    Func->>Cosmos: create_dispute (intake status)
    Func->>Cosmos: create_timeline_event (ingested)

    Note over Func,Foundry: Triage at intake
    Func->>Foundry: score_dispute (triage_agent_client)
    Foundry-->>Func: winProbability + category
    Func->>Cosmos: upsert (score) + score_generated event

    Note over Func,DF: Async pipeline
    Func->>DF: start_dispute_orchestration
    DF->>Func: assemble_case (activity)

    par Evidence + Analysis
        Func->>Func: retrieve_evidence_for_dispute (mock)
        Func->>Func: detect_gaps (gaps_service)
        Func->>Func: score_case (scoring_service)
        Func->>Foundry: draft_rebuttal (maker_agent_client)
        Foundry-->>Func: grounded rebuttal + citations
    end
    Func->>Cosmos: upsert (evidenceGaps, winProbability, rebuttalDraft)

    Note over Blob,Func: Alt path: network file drop
    Blob->>EG: BlobCreated event
    EG->>Func: pl_ingest_raw_event trigger
    Func->>Cosmos: create_dispute (from network file)

    Analyst->>APortal: Open case detail
    APortal->>Func: GET /api/cases/{id}
    Func->>Cosmos: read dispute
    Cosmos-->>APortal: full case + timeline

    opt Analyst re-runs pipeline
        Analyst->>APortal: Click Re-run AI Pipeline
        APortal->>Func: POST /disputes/{id}/reprocess
        Func->>Foundry: draft_rebuttal (fresh)
        Func->>Cosmos: upsert refreshed values
    end

    Analyst->>APortal: Approve / Deny / Escalate
    APortal->>Func: POST /api/cases/{id}/approve
    Func->>Cosmos: update_case_status (approved)
    Func->>DF: raise analyst_decision event
    DF->>Func: submit_to_network (activity, stub)

    Cosmos-->>Fabric: mirrored data
    Fabric-->>Analyst: ops dashboards, deadline reports
